                <td width=572 valign=center colspan=10 style="width:343.6000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:none;
mso-border-left-alt:none;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>The Integrated Experiments of Pharmacy is a comprehensive pharmaceutical experimental teaching system that includes content such as AI Pharmacy (including AIDD, CADD), Physiologically Based Pharmacokinetic Modeling, Chemical Synthesis, Natural Product Extraction, Biosynthesis, Pharmaceutical Preparations, Pharmaceutical Analysis, Pharmacology and Pharmacometrics. The course combines AI Pharmacy (including AIDD, CADD) and Physiologically Based Pharmacokinetic Modeling with other pharmaceutical disciplines. The AI Pharmacy Experiment and&nbsp; physiologically based pharmacokinetic modeling Experiment are the compulsory experimental contents (42 class hours). The others are divided into 4 optional experimental contents&nbsp; (30 class hours each) according to 4 course directions: The chemical synthesis、activity and quality evaluation of drugs; The extraction, activity and quality evaluation of natural product; The preparation and quality evaluation of biologically active macromolecules; The pharmaceutical preparation design and quality evaluation.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:19.9000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
